WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Majed: Someone's collapsed! Come quick! Hurry!

00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:13.542
Noura: Sierra 2, Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22, over.

00:00:13.742 --> 00:00:21.742
Noura: North concourse, Kiosk 6. Medical Assistance. One man, about 40, sitting on the floor, holding his left ankle. I am staying with him. Over.
